          <ul style="font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-left: 1.25rem;">
            <li>Discounted Subtotal: $50 - $15 = $35.00</li>
            <li>Sales Tax (8% of $35): $2.80</li>
